# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# A screenshot from the Tiku menu, saved to ~/Pictures.
#
# The desk can already draw itself to a PNG for the test harness; this
# is that, offered to a person: a menu item that saves the screen, taken
# a frame later so the menu it was picked from is not in the shot.
wait 40
click 20 8
wait 4
expect-menu About this system…||Find…|Preferences…||Take Screenshot||Shut down…
menu-pick Take Screenshot
wait 40
note the status line names the file it saved
expect-read status screenshot saved
quit
